      "questionHtml": "<p>Solve the following:&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(24 - \\left[ {25 - \\left\\{ {26 - \\left( {27 - \\overline {28 - 29} } \\right)} \\right\\}} \\right] = \\;?\\)</span>&nbsp;</p>\n",
