      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p>&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(24 - \\left[ {25 - \\left\\{ {26 - \\left( {27 - \\overline {28 - 29} } \\right)} \\right\\}} \\right] \\)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr; ? = 24 - [25 - {26 - (27 - (-&nbsp;1))}]</span></p>\n\n<p>&rArr; ? = 24 - [25 - {26 - (27 + 1)}]</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; ? = 24 - [25 - {26 - 28}]</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; ? = 24 - [25 + 2]</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; ? = 24 - 27</p>\n&rArr; ? = -3",
